# Client working papers and source documents.
#
# Deliberately NOT tracked. This directory holds client tax working papers and
# the source documents they are built from: ATO pre-filling reports, notices of
# assessment, tax return summaries and client correspondence. Those contain tax
# file numbers, dates of birth, residential addresses and income details.
#
# Client work belongs in FYI and XPM, which are access-controlled. It must not be
# pushed to a code repository. Keep it out of git.
work/
